# Day 53

## Experiment Title

Deploying Applications using Jenkins


## Objective

To understand how Jenkins can be used for automated application deployment.


## Theory

Jenkins supports Continuous Deployment by automating the process of application delivery after successful builds and testing. Deployment automation reduces manual work and improves software delivery speed.

Jenkins pipelines can execute deployment steps automatically and help maintain consistent deployment processes across different environments.


## Requirements

Jenkins

Java Development Kit

GitHub Repository

Docker Desktop

Windows Operating System


## Procedure

Open the Jenkins dashboard.

Access the Jenkins deployment pipeline project.

Configure deployment stages inside the pipeline.

Save the pipeline configuration.

Execute the deployment process through Jenkins.

Verify successful application deployment and execution.


## Output

Application deployment was completed successfully using Jenkins.

Pipeline execution completed successfully during deployment stages.

Deployment logs and execution details were displayed correctly.


## Result

Successfully automated application deployment using Jenkins.
